          "id": "c1",
          "value": {
            "language": "en",
            "text": "湖南环境生物职业技术学院 is a public vocational higher education institution in Shigu District, Hengyang, Hunan, China. The Chinese Wikipedia describes it as having north and south campuses and places its address at 165 Wangcheng Road. Its school identification code is 4143012739.\n\nIts predecessor, 湖南农学院衡阳分院, was established in Hengyang in 1975. The institution was later known as 湖南林业高等专科学校, which was elevated to a higher vocational school in 1999. It adopted its present name in 2001, and 衡阳市卫生学校 merged into it in 2004. The source gives 1978 for the earlier name change but explicitly questions that date.\n\nThe institution’s listed academic units cover biological engineering, landscape studies, business, art and design, nursing and medicine. Wikipedia also lists a journal founded in 1995. Its infobox records 13,849 students and 691 teachers, but does not date those figures; they should therefore be treated as historical observations rather than current enrollment or staffing."
          },
          "verification": "supported"
        }
      ],
